{
 "id": "9544f03b-c2a8-4cf7-a488-880e80430197",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Hanayome  ～ Shitagerareteita Watashi Ga Teito No Shugojin Ni Dekiai Sareru ～"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "華嫁（はなよめ）～虐げられていた私が帝都の守護神に溺愛される～"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Born into a family that serves the Four Guardians of the Imperial Capital, she was nothing like the others—lacking any spiritual power, making her worthless in their eyes.\nAs if that wasn’t enough, she was blamed for a tragic incident in the past, labeled a “sinner”, and forced to live a miserable existence in an abandoned corner of their grand estate.\nBut everything changes when she encounters the leader of one of the guardian families. The moment he touches her, something unbelievable happens—flowers begin to bloom from her body! That single encounter marks the turning point in her life, setting her on a path she never imagined possible.\nWas she truly “worthless”, or had her hidden power been waiting all along for the right person to awaken it?\n\nA captivating fantasy romance with a Japanese touch, where pain turns into strength, and the outcast becomes the most cherished woman in the empire!",
   "ja": "私は『価値なし』で『咎人』だった──。帝都を守る──四神を司る四神相家に仕える家に生まれながら霊力が顕れない『価値なし』で、過去に凄惨な事件を引き起こした『咎人』として一族中から虐げられ、屋敷の敷地の片隅で惨めな生活を強いられていた紗夜はある日、四神相家・玄武の黒檀家の若き当主、御影と出逢う。御影が紗夜に触れた瞬間、身体から美しい花が咲いて──？一つの出逢いが薄幸の少女の運命を変える、和風ロマンスファンタジー。"
  },
